  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The power of your attack stuns your enemy while destroying its defenses.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Crushing Blow<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If the target of your Crushing Blow fails its Fortitude save, its AC is reduced as normal and it is stunned for 1 round. You may also expend one use of mythic power as a free action after a successful Crushing Blow to add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the reduction in the target’s AC.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
